//! Entries slice — Batch 220 (Plan 220) — Lead 13: the prism #107 `MoE`
//! weighted-reduce fusion (own rule; the three staging-row atoms —
//! consumer-fold-into-REDUCTION, bit-identity-intrinsics, dying-operand
//! staging — one mechanism, zero prior owners). Quotes re-verified
//! VERBATIM at the pin (the FULL .patch fetched at conversion:
//! PrismML-Eng/llama.cpp PR #107, patch commit `930ddba3b7f07c1599354d2…`,
//! 876 lines, 6 files, +734).
//!
//! DEDUP (run at authoring, 3+ vocabularies): zero prior owners — the
//! B208 identity-selection rule owns fusion-ADMISSION operand selection;
//! the producer-folds family owns the PRODUCER-side fold (no other
//! reader); the argmax-epilogue rule owns never-materialize at a store
